{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在TVB節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽教授了一道「豆瓣麻辣鱔片」。這道菜不但鱔肉味道恰到好處，配菜的芹菜更是爽口又脆，絕對是炎炎夏日的惹味之選。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"41ead95a-9781-4aed-8df3-f0cfdb82f19f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026hUaAb5KrGF1786009790.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"41ead95a-9781-4aed-8df3-f0cfdb82f19f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>豆瓣麻辣鱔片｜準備食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">白鱔</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">胡椒粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紹興酒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豆瓣醬</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麻辣醬</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芹菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">辣椒</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>豆瓣麻辣鱔片｜詳細做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e910073a-61f5-4621-b139-d41132aa85ef.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026uQ6r7oJ0lJ1786009794.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e910073a-61f5-4621-b139-d41132aa85ef.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T02:18:45.209037+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}